WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.849 --> 00:00:15.735
Jenny wasn't sure about letting us hypnotize her.

2
00:00:15.755 --> 00:00:19.056
"Don't worry, it will be fun!"

3
00:00:19.396 --> 00:00:20.056
said Josh.

4
00:00:21.137 --> 00:00:24.798
"All you have to do is sit and stare straight ahead," I added.

5
00:00:26.659 --> 00:00:28.400
At last Jenny said okay.

6
00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:31.881
"Maybe it will solve my school problems."

7
00:00:31.901 --> 00:00:37.342
"We need a necklace or something shiny to swing in front of you," I said.

8
00:00:37.362 --> 00:00:41.763
"I'll go get something from my jewelry box," said Molly.

9
00:00:43.884 --> 00:00:45.685
She ran upstairs to her apartment.

10
00:00:50.006 --> 00:00:51.486
A minute later she came back.

11
00:00:52.446 --> 00:00:55.307
She was holding a necklace with a big silver heart.

12
00:00:55.327 --> 00:00:58.068
"Perfect!" I said.

13
00:00:59.796 --> 00:01:03.218
"Now keep your eyes on this heart," I instructed Jenny.

14
00:01:04.199 --> 00:01:07.421
I swung the heart back and forth slowly in front of her.

15
00:01:08.501 --> 00:01:10.102
Jenny followed it with her eyes.

16
00:01:10.122 --> 00:01:15.586
"You're getting sleepy," I said in a soft voice.

17
00:01:16.446 --> 00:01:19.288
"Very, very sleepy."

18
00:01:23.130 --> 00:01:24.391
she hypnotized yet?"

19
00:01:24.871 --> 00:01:25.532
asked Molly.

20
00:01:27.284 --> 00:01:29.745
I snapped my fingers in front of Jenny's face.

21
00:01:30.465 --> 00:01:30.986
She blinked.

22
00:01:31.006 --> 00:01:33.927
"Not quite," I said.

23
00:01:33.947 --> 00:01:35.708
I swung the heart again.

24
00:01:37.408 --> 00:01:39.069
Jenny just sat there, staring.

25
00:01:39.089 --> 00:01:43.811
"I think she's hypnotized now," whispered Josh.

26
00:01:46.232 --> 00:01:49.133
"Jenny!" I said in a loud, commanding voice.

27
00:01:49.153 --> 00:01:52.675
"Tell us why you are having trouble in school!"

28
00:01:54.316 --> 00:01:54.996
Jenny blinked.

29
00:01:55.712 --> 00:01:57.533
"Iggy, why are you yelling at me?"

30
00:01:57.553 --> 00:02:01.656
"Jenny, you're not supposed to blink," I said.

31
00:02:01.676 --> 00:02:04.178
"That ruins the spell."

32
00:02:05.459 --> 00:02:06.739
Jenny rubbed her eyes.

33
00:02:06.759 --> 00:02:08.881
"I can't help it.

34
00:02:09.321 --> 00:02:11.983
That swinging heart made my eyes all blurry."

35
00:02:12.003 --> 00:02:15.365
"I'm afraid the trance is broken," I said.

36
00:02:16.446 --> 00:02:17.667
Jenny looked disappointed.

37
00:02:17.687 --> 00:02:20.228
"I was hoping this would work."

38
00:02:20.248 --> 00:02:23.270
"Me too," I said.

39
00:02:23.290 --> 00:02:26.385
"Jenny!" called Mr.

40
00:02:26.505 --> 00:02:29.967
Chen. "It's time to study for your math test."

41
00:02:29.987 --> 00:02:33.429
"Good luck," I said to Jenny.

42
00:02:34.350 --> 00:02:36.552
I felt bad that I had not been able to help her.

43
00:02:39.594 --> 00:02:42.836
The next day at recess, Molly and Jenny wanted to go on the slide.

44
00:02:45.297 --> 00:02:46.518
But I wasn't in the mood.

45
00:02:47.859 --> 00:02:49.861
All the kids in line were yelling and pushing.

46
00:02:49.881 --> 00:02:52.943
"Hey, stop shoving!"

47
00:02:53.543 --> 00:02:54.684
yelled a girl to Evan.

48
00:02:55.688 --> 00:02:56.469
"I didn't shove.

49
00:02:57.129 --> 00:02:59.571
It was the kid behind me," said Evan.

50
00:03:02.414 --> 00:03:02.994
Soon Mr.

51
00:03:03.034 --> 00:03:04.796
Dalmati blew his whistle.

52
00:03:04.816 --> 00:03:06.878
"Recess is over.

53
00:03:07.398 --> 00:03:10.000
Everyone line up to go inside quietly."

54
00:03:10.020 --> 00:03:15.945
"I dropped my new hair clip," said Jenny, looking around.

55
00:03:15.965 --> 00:03:19.088
"And now I can't find it."

56
00:03:19.108 --> 00:03:23.932
"Here it is," said Molly, leaning over to pick it up.

57
00:03:25.036 --> 00:03:26.617
"It was right under your nose."

58
00:03:27.837 --> 00:03:30.598
"Right under your nose," I thought.

59
00:03:31.719 --> 00:03:33.300
The famous inventor, Mr.

60
00:03:33.360 --> 00:03:35.160
Bright, was coming to our school soon.

61
00:03:36.201 --> 00:03:40.342
I had a feeling there was an invention idea right under my nose.

62
00:03:41.823 --> 00:03:43.524
But I couldn't think of what it was.

63
00:03:48.706 --> 00:03:53.288
Walking home after school that day, we passed a new shop, Mom's Bakery.

64
00:03:55.204 --> 00:03:56.685
Actually, we smelled it first.

65
00:03:57.465 --> 00:03:59.346
And did it smell good!

66
00:04:01.388 --> 00:04:05.090
Jenny, Josh, Molly, and I stopped and looked in the window.

67
00:04:06.270 --> 00:04:10.192
It was filled with chocolate brownies, cookies, and frosted cupcakes.

68
00:04:10.212 --> 00:04:14.055
"I wish that was my mom's bakeshop!"

69
00:04:14.355 --> 00:04:14.835
I said.

70
00:04:14.855 --> 00:04:18.757
"I'm starving," said Josh.

71
00:04:20.538 --> 00:04:23.720
"My mouth is watering," said Molly.

72
00:04:25.036 --> 00:04:27.018
"But I don't have any money with me."

73
00:04:30.681 --> 00:04:32.663
We went into the crowded bakeshop.

74
00:04:32.683 --> 00:04:35.205
"Number seven is next!"

75
00:04:35.925 --> 00:04:37.707
called a man from behind the counter.

76
00:04:39.448 --> 00:04:41.050
A woman stepped up to the counter.

77
00:04:41.070 --> 00:04:43.392
"I have number seven."

78
00:04:44.212 --> 00:04:45.714
She handed the man a ticket.

79
00:04:45.734 --> 00:04:49.036
"I'd like a chocolate chip cookie, please."

80
00:04:50.458 --> 00:04:52.980
The man took the woman's ticket and gave her a cookie.

81
00:04:54.696 --> 00:04:55.436
"Number eight!"

82
00:04:55.816 --> 00:04:56.737
he called out next.

83
00:04:58.277 --> 00:05:00.858
I noticed that everyone was holding a numbered ticket.

84
00:05:03.478 --> 00:05:05.479
That's when the idea came to me.

85
00:05:05.499 --> 00:05:07.120
"I've got it!"

86
00:05:07.520 --> 00:05:08.120
I cried.

87
00:05:08.140 --> 00:05:09.780
"Got what?"

88
00:05:10.180 --> 00:05:10.861
asked Molly.

89
00:05:10.881 --> 00:05:13.961
"An idea for a new invention!"

90
00:05:14.462 --> 00:05:14.862
I said.

91
00:05:14.882 --> 00:05:17.862
"And you know what the amazing thing is?"

92
00:05:17.882 --> 00:05:21.043
"What?" said Josh.

93
00:05:22.304 --> 00:05:22.964
I grinned.

94
00:05:23.744 --> 00:05:26.951
"The idea was right under my nose!"
